Union line on Cemetery Ridge: three divisions, some twelve thousand men,
across nearly a mile of open fields, aiming for a copse of trees behind
a low stone wall.  First the guns, then the infantry.  Play either side
against the computer, or against a friend at the same screen.

Run it with ./pickett (Python 3 with Tk, nothing else).  The game is
saved to ~/.pickett.json.  ./pickett --selftest checks the map and plays
a game between two computer players.
"""

